WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.980
After the surgery site has healed, you return

2
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.740
for your first programming visit.

3
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.460
At this visit, a hearing specialist called an

4
00:00:09.524 --> 00:00:13.380
audiologist programs the speech processor you wear outside

5
00:00:13.412 --> 00:00:14.020
your ear.

6
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.900
The program is made for your needs.

7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.980
At later visits, the team checks the implant

8
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.380
